{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111935790804578304"]},"author_id":"1494528146896572418","created_at":"2026-10-18T21:41:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111935794231304390"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/1hZYB2DU6f","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ServingResearch/status/2111935794231304390/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111935790804578304","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/1hZYB2DU6f"}]},"id":"2111935794231304390","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":113,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"From roughly October 6–17, semiconductor and data-center names posted their longest sustained declines since 2008. SOX fell eight consecutive sessions and ~16% from early-October levels; SOXX tracked similarly. Memory led: Micron declined ~19% from recent highs, SK Hynix dropped https://t.co/1hZYB2DU6f","url":"https://x.com/ServingResearch/status/2111935794231304390"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111994974619209728"]},"author_id":"1795225089455120384","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:36:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111994981267251369"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/b0R9xUYZ4Z","end":293,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/EliasGiorda/status/2111994981267251369/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111994974619209728","start":270,"url":"https://t.co/b0R9xUYZ4Z"},{"display_url":"x.com/zerohedge/stat…","end":317,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/zerohedge/status/2111987220479660157","start":294,"url":"https://t.co/VRGRrDO1o5"}]},"id":"2111994981267251369","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":54,"impression_count":10059,"like_count":47,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":3},"text":"Morgan Stanley mapeó a quién le va a llegar el capex de IA de 2027. Total: $1.58T.\n\nSumé los nodos del propio gráfico y no cierra:\n\n🔹 Fuentes: 375 GOOGL + 270 AMZN + 209 MSFT + 221 META + 195 leases + 132 SpaceX + 97 ORCL + 47 CRWV + 37 NBIS = $1.583T ✅\n🔸 Destinos: 672 https://t.co/b0R9xUYZ4Z https://t.co/VRGRrDO1o5","url":"https://x.com/EliasGiorda/status/2111994981267251369"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111986256972599297","3_2111986295992111104"]},"author_id":"960804070117187584","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:04:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111986845626376336"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/1ukDzYNx4U","end":177,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/paurooteri/status/2111986845626376336/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111986256972599297","start":154,"url":"https://t.co/1ukDzYNx4U"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/1ukDzYNx4U","end":177,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/paurooteri/status/2111986845626376336/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111986295992111104","start":154,"url":"https://t.co/1ukDzYNx4U"}]},"id":"2111986845626376336","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":65,"impression_count":34763,"like_count":252,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":22},"text":"この記事すごいね\n本当に色々衝撃的なことが書いてある\nまさかSamsungがTSMCのベースダイをNVHBMとは言え採用する方向とは\n\nサムスン・TSMC、先端プロセス活用しHBM供給量を拡大…「メモリのボトルネック」を突破へ\n\n■サムスン・TSMC「呉越同舟」\n独自の「NVHBM」を開発するエヌビディア https://t.co/1ukDzYNx4U","url":"https://x.com/paurooteri/status/2111986845626376336"},{"author_id":"1975518700817293313","created_at":"2026-10-18T23:11:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111958329912373704"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":88,"id":"1975518700817293313","start":72,"username":"Semiconductorge"}],"urls":[{"description":"要約 TSMCはAI半導体需要を背景に、2026年の売上高成長率見通しを44％に引き上げた。証券各社は2027～2028年の設備投資予測を上方修正し、2nmの量産拡大やCoWoS増強が成長を牽引するとみる。一方、先端製造コストの増加による利益率への影響が課題となる。 キーワード５つ TSMC、2nm、設備投資、CoWoS、先端パッケージング 記事の翻訳 TSMCの強気な決算を受け、証券各社は設備投資予測を上方修正　焦点は利益率 TSMCの強気な決算説明会を受け、海外証券会社はおおむね前向きな評価を示している。半導体受託製造大手のTSMCは、2026年の売上高成長率見通しを前年","display_url":"note.com/loyal_myrtle15…","end":112,"expanded_url":"https://note.com/loyal_myrtle1528/n/na957fb17ac3a","images":[{"height":670,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111958372899815424/8h1Hz_bz?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111958372899815424/8h1Hz_bz?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":89,"status":200,"title":"TSMC、2028年の設備投資は最大1,050億ドルへ！2nm・CoWoS増強でAI半導体需要を取り込む｜Semiconductor Geek","unwound_url":"https://note.com/loyal_myrtle1528/n/na957fb17ac3a","url":"https://t.co/FAXH1FbGTP"}]},"id":"2111958329912373704","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":38,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"TSMC、2028年の設備投資は最大1,050億ドルへ！2nm・CoWoS増強でAI半導体需要を取り込む｜Semiconductor Geek @Semiconductorge https://t.co/FAXH1FbGTP","url":"https://x.com/Semiconductorge/status/2111958329912373704"},{"article":{"title":"TSM$"},"author_id":"2110804271243427840","created_at":"2026-10-18T22:27:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111947266986484020"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2111…","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2111905437549256705","start":0,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2111905437549256705","url":"https://t.co/VhEJtGwwjB"}]},"id":"2111947266986484020","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":23,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/VhEJtGwwjB","url":"https://x.com/MyStockButler/status/2111947266986484020"},{"author_id":"2086718593807593474","created_at":"2026-10-19T00:02:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111971137609757016"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":144,"start":139,"tag":"TSMC"},{"end":149,"start":145,"tag":"日本株"},{"end":156,"start":150,"tag":"AI半導体"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/tatuo_seadrago…","end":180,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/tatuo_seadragon/status/2111847940100850073","start":157,"url":"https://t.co/VX9IejiYxQ"}]},"id":"2111971137609757016","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"TSMCは絶好調。\n\n売上高＋50.9％、純利益＋68.7％。\n\nそれでも、AI半導体の未来を考えるとき、チップの性能や生産能力だけを見ていてよいのでしょうか。\n\n決算資料から読み取れる経営陣の「強気と選択」、2nm、CoWoS、そしてAIインフラの課題まで掘り下げました。\n\n#TSMC #日本株 #AI半導体 https://t.co/VX9IejiYxQ","url":"https://x.com/tatuo_seadragon/status/2111971137609757016"},{"author_id":"923960315343245314","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:59:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112000663714484485"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/supplyradarx/s…","end":182,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/supplyradarx/status/2111991791855821228","start":159,"url":"https://t.co/P5WtNavzNK"}]},"id":"2112000663714484485","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4073,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我记得这个早有铺垫，24年三星就允许客户自行设计base die，然后不限定在三星自家晶圆厂生产，同时最近也传出NVHBM走“三星代工/台积电”双轨，链接在下方，可以看看。\n\n关键还是英伟达把内存控制器塞进了base die，它本质上成了GPU的外置逻辑芯片，IP和CoWoS都在台积电体系里，指定台积电是顺理成章。 https://t.co/P5WtNavzNK","url":"https://x.com/cherryPayment/status/2112000663714484485"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111962057163816960"]},"author_id":"1854787084378361856","created_at":"2026-10-18T23:26:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111962064323502398","2111965410069561349"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/cg4aebIwZe","end":181,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/NASP250/status/2111962064323502398/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111962057163816960","start":158,"url":"https://t.co/cg4aebIwZe"}]},"id":"2111962064323502398","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":718,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"注目🐼サムスン🇰🇷🤝TSMC🇹🇼がNVIDIA向けHBM製造‼️\n\n⭐️サムスン電子、NVIDIA向け次世代の特注HBMの「ベースダイ」を、TSMCの3nmで製造へ、ソウル経済新聞‼️\n┣ 10月18日にソウル経済新聞が報道(ロイターが伝達)\n┣ ベースダイは、HBMの土台となる、データの流れを制御するチップ\n┗ https://t.co/cg4aebIwZe","url":"https://x.com/NASP250/status/2111962064323502398"},{"author_id":"186611769","created_at":"2026-10-18T22:48:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111952701777211399"],"id":"2111952701777211399","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":824,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Q3.2026 실적 분석 완료한 기업       \n\n1. 실적레포트(3개) : 마이크론(FY Q4.2026), ASML, TSMC          \n\n2. 실적분석 강의영상(2개) : 마이크론(FY Q4.2026), ASML\n\nQ2.2026 실적 분석 완료한 기업                     \n\n1. 실적레포트(24개) : 테슬라, 스페이스X, 엔비디아, 구글, 마소,","url":"https://x.com/PForever0000/status/2111952701777211399"},{"author_id":"1307411656784277504","created_at":"2026-10-19T00:08:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111972764425097550"],"id":"2111972764425097550","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":9837,"like_count":105,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":10},"text":"NVDA, TSM, MU: Nvidia custom HBM hits 30% more bandwidth while UBS flags 91% demand surge and 10% supply shortfall\n\n+ Nvidia is working with Samsung and TSMC to design the base die for NVHBM, its custom HBM, per Seoul Economic Daily. Shifting the memory controller off the GPU","url":"https://x.com/The_AI_Investor/status/2111972764425097550"},{"author_id":"14771503","created_at":"2026-10-18T23:32:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111963687447871980"],"id":"2111963687447871980","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":37,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Nvidia reportedly asks Samsung to make HBM base dies on TSMC 3nm.\n&lt;엔비디아 맞춤 메모리, 삼성이 TSMC 공정을 쓴다&gt;\n1. 엔비디아가 3사에 NVHBM 베이스 다이를 TSMC 3nm로 요청, 삼성 수락\n2. 메모리사가 경쟁 파운드리에 로직을 맡김. 주도권은 사양 쥔 쪽\n3. 표준품에서 맞춤품으로. 고객","url":"https://x.com/kreia/status/2111963687447871980"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111975296379543552","3_2111975296371163136","3_2111975296392175616"]},"author_id":"1586353857676083200","created_at":"2026-10-19T00:18:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111975327128064361"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/IZxQDVJII9","end":210,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/tsla_boy/status/2111975327128064361/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111975296379543552","start":187,"url":"https://t.co/IZxQDVJII9"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/IZxQDVJII9","end":210,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/tsla_boy/status/2111975327128064361/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111975296371163136","start":187,"url":"https://t.co/IZxQDVJII9"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/IZxQDVJII9","end":210,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/tsla_boy/status/2111975327128064361/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111975296392175616","start":187,"url":"https://t.co/IZxQDVJII9"}]},"id":"2111975327128064361","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":58,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"3나노 TSMC로 만드는 엔비디아 HBM… 삼성, 라이벌 손 잡았다 🧩\n\n서울경제·로이터: 엔비디아가 맞춤형 HBM(NVHBM) 베이스 다이를 TSMC 3나노로 만들라고 삼성·SK하이닉스·마이크론에 요청, 삼성은 처음으로 TSMC 공정 쓰기로. UBS는 내년 HBM 수요 91% 증가, 공급은 10% 부족 전망\n\n쉽게 말하면…\nHBM https://t.co/IZxQDVJII9","url":"https://x.com/tsla_boy/status/2111975327128064361"},{"author_id":"2902220942","created_at":"2026-10-18T23:07:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111957275359465943"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"韓媒報導，輝達要求其客製化高頻寬記憶體（HBM），基礎晶粒（base die）部分須使用台積電3奈米，原因之一是台積良率超過90%，三星電子因此須與台積電攜手。","display_url":"money.udn.com/money/story/56…","end":82,"expanded_url":"https://money.udn.com/money/story/5612/9822784","images":[{"height":246,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111957283521642496/6SfzPuNA?format=jpg&name=orig","width":470},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111957283521642496/6SfzPuNA?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":59,"status":200,"title":"輝達 HBM 採用權王3奈米 | 產業熱點 | 產業 | 經濟日報","unwound_url":"https://money.udn.com/money/story/5612/9822784","url":"https://t.co/n8LKujeVYG"}]},"id":"2111957275359465943","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1002,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"[經濟日報] 03:33 掲載\n\nNVIDIA、TSMC 3nmおよびHBMを採用\n\n輝達 HBM 採用權王3奈米\n\nhttps://t.co/n8LKujeVYG","url":"https://x.com/miraclemasui/status/2111957275359465943"},{"author_id":"1151253688704352257","created_at":"2026-10-18T23:42:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111966053521826077"],"id":"2111966053521826077","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Nvidia isn't just buying HBM. It's dictating how it's made.\n\nSamsung will reportedly use TSMC 3nm for the base die of Nvidia's custom HBM, and Nvidia wants SK hynix and Micron on the same spec.\n\nMy read after 31 years: it's only a concession if the order terms don't pay for it.","url":"https://x.com/tai_semicon/status/2111966053521826077"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111978673461170176"]},"author_id":"2025445453043826691","created_at":"2026-10-19T00:32:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111978684362224051"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":36,"start":32,"tag":"TSM"},{"end":65,"start":60,"tag":"NVDA"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/pSiqflazEE","end":200,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/marketradar_kr/status/2111978684362224051/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111978673461170176","start":177,"url":"https://t.co/pSiqflazEE"}]},"id":"2111978684362224051","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":101,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"파운드리를 가진 삼성전자가, HBM 핵심 부품을 TSMC $TSM  3나노로 만든다고요?\n\n그런데 엔비디아($NVDA )가 공급사 모두에 요구한 조건이라고 보도됐습니다.\n\n보도상 턴키의 예외는 NVHBM이고, 표준 HBM은 자사 파운드리를 유지합니다.\n\nTSMC 자리가 모자라면 그 몫이 삼성 파운드리로 돌아올까요? https://t.co/pSiqflazEE","url":"https://x.com/marketradar_kr/status/2111978684362224051"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111927513035501568"]},"author_id":"1988454162057826304","created_at":"2026-10-18T21:15:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111929116509552673"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":27,"id":"1988454162057826304","start":16,"username":"antfeedapp"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/hdbjIGWbxb","end":293,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/antfeedapp/status/2111929116509552673/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111927513035501568","start":270,"url":"https://t.co/hdbjIGWbxb"},{"display_url":"x.com/antfeedapp/sta…","end":317,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/antfeedapp/status/2111922494278160583","start":294,"url":"https://t.co/zXIXC24LhY"}]},"id":"2111929116